      "summary": "Open uncertainties at end of evidence (09:24Z).",
      "detail": "Unknown / unresolved: (1) why r184's DB_POOL_MAX was set to 4 is not established by the evidence; (2) whether pausing the rollout at 09:22Z stopped further 503 growth is unconfirmed because the evidence ends at 09:24Z; (3) whether any checkout requests were lost or double-charged is unknown; (4) no application error-log or trace artifact is available, so the failure is inferred from metrics correlation only. These require the tests in the follow-up tasks.",
